<title>CANADA: DBRS confirms National Bank Canada ratings.</title>
<headline>DBRS confirms National Bank Canada ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service on Wednesday confirmed all ratings on the National Bank of Canada with a continuing stable trend.</p>
</text>
